1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:03,540
Greek Island Holidays,can I help you?
希腊岛度假，需要帮忙吗？

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:12,110
Yes,I hope so.I have a friend who's just come back from Corfu and she's recommended some apartments in Arilas.
是的，我希望是。我有一个朋友刚从科孚岛回来，她推荐了一些在阿里拉斯的公寓。

3
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,200
She thought they might be on your list.
她认为你们的名单上会有这些。

4
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,880
Arilas,Arilas,let me see.
阿里拉斯，阿里拉斯，让我看看。

5
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,230
Can you give me the names?
你能告诉我名字吗？

6
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,970
Yes,the first's Rose Garden Apartments.
好的，第一个是玫瑰园公寓。

7
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:28,160
I'd like to go with another friend in the last week of October.
我想在十月的最后一周和另一个朋友去。

8
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:32,560
Well,we've got a lovely studio flat available at that time.
那时候我们有一个美丽的一居室公寓可以使用。

9
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:38,370
I'm sure you'd enjoy the entertainment programme there too,with Greek dancing in the restaurant.
我肯定你还会喜欢那里的娱乐节目，饭店里有希腊舞蹈。

10
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:42,440
And the cost for each of us? ￡219.
我们每个人要多少钱？219英镑。

11
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,240
That sounds very reasonable!
听起来很合理！

12
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,950
I'm just jotting down some notes.
我记一下笔记。

13
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:52,010
Now the second one she mentioned was called Blue Bay.
现在，她提到的第二家叫做蓝色海湾。

14
00:00:52,020 --> 00:01:00,180
Blue Bay?Yes,in fact that's very popular and it has some special features. Really?
蓝色海湾？是的，事实上这个非常受欢迎，它还有一些特色。真的吗？

15
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:04,010
The main attraction is the large swimming pool with salt water.
它的主要景点是大型盐水游泳池。

16
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:06,140
Much healthier,I understand.
更健康，我明白。

17
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:18,110
That's right.And it isn't far from the beach,either - only 300 metres,and only around half a kilometre to some shops,so you don't have to be too energetic.
没错。它离海滩不远，只有300米的距离，离一些商店只有半公里左右的路程，所以你不会消耗很多体力。

18
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:21,170
Is it much more expensive than the first one?
它比第一个贵很多吗？

19
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:31,860
Let me just check.I think at the time you want to go it's around ￡260 - no ￡275 to be exact.
让我查查。我想你来的时候应该是260英镑左右，不，确切的说是275英镑。

20
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:37,440
Right,I've got that.Now there are just two more apartments to ask you about.
好的，我记下了。现在我还有两个公寓要咨询。

21
00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:43,280
Um,I can't read my own writing!Something to do with sun...Sunshine,is it?
我看不懂我的笔迹了！跟太阳……阳光有关的，是吗？

22
00:01:43,290 --> 00:01:49,540
I think you meant the Sunshade Apartments.They're on a mountainside. Any special features?
我想你说的是天棚公寓。它们在山坡上。有什么特色吗？

23
00:01:49,550 --> 00:01:57,010
Yes,each room has its own sun terrace and there are shared barbecue facilities. Sounds lovely!
是的。每个房间都自带阳光露台，还可以共享烧烤设施。-听起来不错！

24
00:01:57,020 --> 00:02:06,310
Yes,it is rather well-equipped.It also provides water sports - it has its own beach.There are facilities for water-skiing.
是的，它的设施很齐全。它还提供水上运动，它有自己的海滩，还有滑水运动的设备。

25
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,400
Any kite-surfing?My friend's quite keen.
有风筝冲浪吗？我朋友很喜欢这个。

26
00:02:09,410 --> 00:02:13,890
Not at the hotel but I'm sure you'll find some in Arilas.
酒店里没有，但是我肯定你会在阿里拉斯找到。

27
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:17,360
There's also satellite TV in the apartments.
公寓里还有卫星电视。

28
00:02:17,370 --> 00:02:22,950
And how much is that one? ￡490 with two sharing.
这个多少钱？。双人490英镑

29
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:26,360
You mean ￡245 each?
你是说一个人245英镑？

30
00:02:26,370 --> 00:02:33,140
I'm afraid not!Each person has to pay that amount and there must be at least two in an apartment.
恐怕不是！每个人都得付那么多钱，而且必须至少一个公寓里有俩人。

31
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:40,770
I don't think that would be within our budget,unfortunately.And the last one sounds a bit expensive too - the Grand!
不幸的是，我觉得这不在我们的预算之内。最后一个听起来也有点贵，格兰德！

32
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:42,910
Actually it's quite reasonable.
事实上这个价格很合理。

33
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:48,410
It's an older style house with Greek paintings in every room,and a balcony outside.
它是老式住宅，每个房间里都有希腊绘画，外面有一个阳台。

34
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,530
Sound nice.What are the views like?
听起来不错。景色怎么样？

35
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:59,130
Well,there are forests all round and they hide a supermarket just dow the road,so that's very useful for all your shopping needs.
周围都是森林，路边藏着一家超市，所以这能满足你的购物需求。

36
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:01,230
There's a disco in the area too.
那里还有一家舞厅。

37
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:12,250
And the price? ￡319 at that time,but if you leave it till November it goes down by 40%. Too late,I'm afraid.
价格呢？-那时候是319英镑，但是如果你11月来会降价40%。恐怕太晚了。

38
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:17,180
Well,why don't i send you a brochure with full details,Ms...?
我发给你一份写有详细信息的宣传册怎么样，请问您是？-纳什。

39
00:03:17,190 --> 00:03:25,010
Nash.But don't worry about that.I'm coming to Upminster soon and I'll call and get one.I just wanted to get an idea first.
不过不用担心。我很快就去阿布敏斯特，我会打电话领取的。我只是想事先了解一下。

40
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:30,080
Well,that's fine.We've got plenty here when you come.
好的，你来的时候，我们这里还有很多。
